3. Ideas and methods (cited; no code copied)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Warrant (agentic engineering write-ups): "do not let a model do arithmetic" — deterministic
     tools compute every number; the model only chooses.
   Plant-as-Code paper ("Engineering process plants as code", arXiv 2610.40239): verification
     layers and Design-Ops; "agents propose, deterministic tools compute and check, only the
     verifier can accept a design, the human approves".
   Engineering equations and values: the reference cards in data/knowledge/reference_cards/
     paraphrase and cite the source books and papers (see docs/hackathon/GEOAGENT_DESIGN_SPEC.md §19).
     The books and papers themselves are not redistributed.

