4. LLM-generated code kept as evidence
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   docs/results/s7_demo/ holds a GEMINI model and test written by the Model Builder agent
   (gemma4:12b-it-q4_K_M, local Ollama) from reference card RC-07, stored as .py.txt so no test
   runner collects it. It is evidence of scenario S7, not part of the application, and is
   licensed like the rest of our code (Apache-2.0).

